
// Dark Skies DLC

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_ExploringOurOptions=Exploring Our Options
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_ExploringOurOptions=We look for near term solutions to our most pressing issues. 
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_ExploringOurOptions=Whatever the aliens' goals are, they seem prefer to pursue them quietly and with methodical subtlety. Still, the world has changed, and we cannot simply sit idly by and wait for scientific progress to enable the kinds of things we need to be doing right now. Our scientists and engineers have begun looking for novel applications of existing technology, and they expect that some exciting new projects will become possible very soon. In addition, our researchers have found some low hanging fruit that we will be able to take advantage of immediately.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectA=Research Grants : Computing
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectA=We acquire research grants in the field of computing.
//TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectA=Targeted funding for computer science has significantly increased the overall rate of scientific progress and driven technological breakthroughs in the field.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectB=Research Grants : Communication
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectB=We acquire research grants in the field of communication.
//TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectB=Expanded funding for communications research has increased the rate of scientific progress and led to improvements in methodology, equipment, and research efficiency.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectC=Research Grants : Space
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectC=We acquire research grants in the field of space science. 
//TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectC=Research grants in the realm of aeronautics and astronomy have increased the rate of scientific progress and improved efficiency within the field of space research.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectD=Research Grants : Defense
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectD=We acquire research grants in the field of defense.
//TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_ResearchRepairProjectD=Additional funding for scientific communities studying the military applications of recent breakthroughs has significantly increased the rate of scientific progress.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandI=Safeguard the Land I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandI=We identify short-term options to secure our interests on Earth.
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandI=The discovery of the aliens' plans for Earth caused quite the shockwave within our organization. We have taken what measures we can to prepare for this. Our researchers have also identified a number of novel avenues of research that may help us in the tumultuous times ahead of us.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandII=Safeguard the Land II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandII=We expand our short-term terrestrial military options.
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandII=We have continued to prepare for an alien military presense on Earth. 

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandIII=Safeguard the Land III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandIII=We conclude our search for new terrestrial military projects.  
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_SafeguardtheLandIII=We have reached the zenith of our short-term preparation options. Any further advancements will require more fundamental scientific progress. 

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_SafeguardtheSkyI=Safeguard the Sky I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_SafeguardtheSkyI=We identify short-term options to secure our interests in space.
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_SafeguardtheSkyI=The aliens have brought military craft into our solar system. Those who fear their intentions will feel the need to protect themselves, and those who don't will nevertheless need to protect themselves from the others. We have done what we can to prepare for this new, more dangerous, solar system. 

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_SafeguardtheSkyII=Safeguard the Sky II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_SafeguardtheSkyII=We conclude our search for new space-based military projects.  
TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_SafeguardtheSkyII=We have further prepared for the militarization of space. At this point, we have reached the zenith of our short-term preparation options. Any further advancements will require more fundamental scientific progress. 

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_BS_MakingHistoryI=Making History : Americas
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_BS_MakingHistoryI=We explore new options in American geopolitics.
//TIProjectTemplate.description.Project_BS_MakingHistoryI=In these very unusual times, some of our more ambitious thinkers believe that they have found some sociopolitical threads to pull in the Americas, should they be in our interest.

